### Third-Party Data Licences & Attributions

QuranGraph strictly honours and maintains verbatim textual integrity for all sacred scriptures and classical translations:

1. **Quranic Text (Arabic Uthmani & Simple Clean)**:
   - Source: Tanzil Project (https://tanzil.net)
   - Licence: Tanzil Terms of Use. The Quranic Arabic text is reproduced verbatim without modification.

2. **Quran Translations & Brief Tafsir**:
   - Source: QuranEnc (https://quranenc.com)
   - English Saheeh International, English Al-Mukhtasar fi Tafsir al-Qur'an, Bengali Dr. Abu Bakr Muhammad Zakaria, Bengali Al-Mukhtasar fi Tafsir al-Qur'an, and Arabic Al-Mukhtasar & Al-Muyassar are displayed verbatim with attribution to their respective scholars and publishers.

3. **Quranic Arabic Corpus & Morphology**:
   - Source: Quranic Arabic Corpus (University of Leeds / Kais Dukes)
   - Used for linguistic root, lemma, and part-of-speech cross-referencing.
